# Project docs (DROT)

When creating or editing README / AGENTS / `docs/` in this repository, **read and follow the `project-docs` skill first**, then apply the customizations below.

Source **documentation comments**, file headers, why-comments → **`inline-code-docs`**.

## Ownership

This repository owns **all DROT-specific** documentation and Cursor rules:

| Surface | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Agent router | [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) |
| Deep reference | [`docs/`](../../docs/) |
| Project README | [`README.md`](../../README.md) |

Hosts link here; do not duplicate TUI/logging/architecture essays in the host. When pinned under a host, follow the host AGENTS/`docs/` for product CI — do not paste them here. Tool version: `[workspace.package].version` in this `Cargo.toml` (not host `dhara.config.toml`).

## Publish / human surfaces

| README | Audience |
|--------|----------|
| [`README.md`](../../README.md) | Operators — CLI/TUI install and usage |
| Host package READMEs | Product runtime (not this tool) |

## Audience

Speak to **operators and contributors** of the orchestration tool (Rust). Mention host products only as facts (e.g. “pin as submodule”), not as storage runtime tutorials.
